{"title":"꿀 발린 S급 가이드 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"S급 가이드 진효섭은 접촉 가이딩 이상은 하지 않겠다는 조건을 걸고 C급 길드 '노아피'에 들어가게 된다.C급 길드원들에게 가이딩을 해주지만, 어딘가 부족한 느낌이 드는 동시에 어딘가에서 계속 다쳐서 오는 길드원들.한편, 다정하지만 능글맞은 구석이 있는 길드장 안단테. 누구보다 효섭을 우선시하고 챙겨주는 모습에 점점 효섭도 그에게 마음을 열기 시작한다.\"접촉 가이딩을 안 하겠다는 이유가 뭐예요? 아, 혹시 거기에 꿀이라도 발라 놨어요?\"\"무, 무슨 그런 말을…\"\"나, 구경시켜 주면 안 돼요?\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":108,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":153,"change":{"type":"down","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":177,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":222,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":204,"change":{"type":"up","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":150,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":174,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","viewCount":"2.8만"},{"date":"2026-10-12","viewCount":"3.7만"},{"date":"2026-10-13","viewCount":"4.4만"},{"date":"2026-10-14","viewCount":"4.9만"},{"date":"2026-10-15","viewCount":"5.4만"},{"date":"2026-10-16","viewCount":"5.9만"}],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-09","v":12802,"rc":62,"rs":611,"cc":9},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":21194,"rc":89,"rs":872,"cc":20},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":29049,"rc":148,"rs":1451,"cc":29},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":38022,"rc":242,"rs":2383,"cc":36},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":44259,"rc":272,"rs":2674,"cc":39},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":4986